sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant FE as Frontend (Next.js)
  participant API as Core API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  User->>FE: Enter username/email and password
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
  API->>DB: Find user in erp_users
  alt Account locked (locked_until in the future)
    API-->>FE: 423 Too many failed attempts
  else Wrong password (bcrypt compare fails)
    API->>DB: failed_logins + 1 (5th failure locks for 15 min), audit "Sign-in Failed"
    API-->>FE: 401 Invalid credentials
  else Account or institution not active
    API-->>FE: 403 Account disabled / institution not active
  else Password correct
    API->>DB: Reset failed_logins, set last_login_at, audit "Signed In"
    API-->>FE: JWT (8 h, or 15 min if must_change_password) + role, permissions, modules
  end
  opt must_change_password = true
    FE->>User: Ask for a new password
    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/change-password
    API->>DB: Store new bcrypt hash (older tokens stop working)
    API-->>FE: Fresh JWT
  end
  FE->>FE: Keep token, open /admin or /portal by role
